    "paragraphs": [
      {
        "id": "ch06.s09.p01",
        "sentences": [
          {
            "id": "ch06.s09.p01.01",
            "text": "How do the downloaded GPT-2 checkpoint files become weights that a GPT implementation can actually use?",
            "type": "C",
            "cites": []
          },
          {
            "id": "ch06.s09.p01.02",
            "text": "The \"download_and_load_gpt2\" function accesses a URL, downloads seven files onto the local machine, and then preprocesses them.",
            "type": "F",
            "cites": [
              "__OiQznq4ao@481",
              "__OiQznq4ao@484",
              "__OiQznq4ao@487",
              "__OiQznq4ao@501",
              "__OiQznq4ao@503",
              "__OiQznq4ao@505"
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "ch06.s09.p01.03",
            "text": "Simply downloading the seven files is not enough, because the downloaded parameters must be converted from the TensorFlow checkpoint into a specific dictionary.",
            "type": "F",
            "cites": [
              "__OiQznq4ao@501",
              "__OiQznq4ao@503",
              "__OiQznq4ao@510",
              "__OiQznq4ao@513",
              "__OiQznq4ao@518",
              "__OiQznq4ao@520"
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "ch06.s09.p01.04",
            "text": "That dictionary makes the parameters much easier to handle and access.",
            "type": "F",
            "cites": [
              "__OiQznq4ao@520",
              "__OiQznq4ao@522",
              "__OiQznq4ao@524"
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "ch06.s09.p01.05",
            "text": "This conversion matters because directly using only the seven downloaded files makes it difficult to integrate those parameters with the GPT code written earlier.",
            "type": "F",
            "cites": [
              "__OiQznq4ao@562",
              "__OiQznq4ao@564",
              "__OiQznq4ao@567",
              "__OiQznq4ao@568",
              "__OiQznq4ao@570",
              "__OiQznq4ao@573",
              "__OiQznq4ao@576"
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "ch06.s09.p02",
        "sentences": [
          {
            "id": "ch06.s09.p02.01",
            "text": "Once that setup is clear, the code can be read as a two-stage loading process.",
            "type": "C",
            "cites": []
          },
          {
            "id": "ch06.s09.p02.02",
            "text": "Running the download code creates a folder called \"355 million\", downloads the seven files, and returns a \"params\" dictionary.",
            "type": "F",
            "cites": [
              "__OiQznq4ao@538",
              "__OiQznq4ao@540",
              "__OiQznq4ao@542",
              "__OiQznq4ao@545",
              "__OiQznq4ao@548",
              "__OiQznq4ao@550"
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "ch06.s09.p02.03",
            "text": "This \"params\" dictionary consists of transformer block parameters, token embeddings, positional embeddings, and final normalization layer parameters in an accessible form.",
            "type": "F",
            "cites": [
              "__OiQznq4ao@550",
              "__OiQznq4ao@552",
              "__OiQznq4ao@554",
              "__OiQznq4ao@556",
              "__OiQznq4ao@557",
              "__OiQznq4ao@560"
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "ch06.s09.p02.04",
            "text": "The code first imports the \"download_and_load_gpt2\" function from the \"GPT_download3.py\" file and stores the results in \"settings\" and \"params\".",
            "type": "F",
            "cites": [
              "__OiQznq4ao@586",
              "__OiQznq4ao@588",
              "__OiQznq4ao@593",
              "__OiQznq4ao@595",
              "__OiQznq4ao@598",
              "__OiQznq4ao@599",
              "__OiQznq4ao@602",
              "__OiQznq4ao@604",
              "__OiQznq4ao@606",
              "__OiQznq4ao@608"
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "ch06.s09.p02.05",
            "text": "For the shown model, the download is 1.42 GB, so it can take a long time if the internet connection is weak, and it helps to have enough memory on the device.",
            "type": "F",
            "cites": [
              "__OiQznq4ao@611",
              "__OiQznq4ao@614",
              "__OiQznq4ao@617",
              "__OiQznq4ao@620",
              "__OiQznq4ao@621",
              "__OiQznq4ao@623",
              "__OiQznq4ao@626",
              "__OiQznq4ao@628",
              "__OiQznq4ao@630",
              "__OiQznq4ao@632",
              "__OiQznq4ao@635",
              "__OiQznq4ao@639"
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "ch06.s09.p03",
        "sentences": [
          {
            "id": "ch06.s09.p03.01",
            "text": "After the files have been downloaded and organized, the next job is to place those values into the model itself.",
            "type": "C",
            "cites": []
          },
          {
            "id": "ch06.s09.p03.02",
            "text": "The \"load_weights_into_gpt\" function maps the downloaded parameters from the \"params\" dictionary into the corresponding trainable parts of the GPT architecture.",
            "type": "F",
            "cites": [
              "__OiQznq4ao@645",
              "__OiQznq4ao@646",
              "__OiQznq4ao@649",
              "__OiQznq4ao@652",
              "__OiQznq4ao@654",
              "__OiQznq4ao@656",
              "__OiQznq4ao@658",
              "__OiQznq4ao@661",
              "__OiQznq4ao@673",
              "__OiQznq4ao@675",
              "__OiQznq4ao@678",
              "__OiQznq4ao@699",
              "__OiQznq4ao@700",
              "__OiQznq4ao@703",
              "__OiQznq4ao@705",
              "__OiQznq4ao@707"
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "ch06.s09.p03.03",
            "text": "You can think of this whole loading block as an assignment step that assigns the downloaded parameters to the model.",
            "type": "F",
            "cites": [
              "__OiQznq4ao@707",
              "__OiQznq4ao@709",
              "__OiQznq4ao@711",
              "__OiQznq4ao@713"
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "ch06.s09.p03.04",
            "text": "After running \"settings, params = download_and_load_gpt2\", the next step is to run \"load_weights_into_gpt\" to load the downloaded weights from the 355 million model into the GPT architecture, and then set the model to evaluation mode.",
            "type": "F",
            "cites": [
              "__OiQznq4ao@725",
              "__OiQznq4ao@727",
              "__OiQznq4ao@728",
